  "text": "\n\t\t 🗳️State GeneralElection🗳️ | Town of Charlestown, NH \nCharlestown, NH \n\t\t Documents \n\t\t News \n\t\t Agendas \n🗳️State GeneralElection🗳️ \n\t\t\tNovember 3, 2026 \nNOTICE: STATE GENERAL ELECTION \n🗓️ Date:  Tuesday, November 3, 2026 \n⏰ Voting Hours:  8:00 AM – 7:00 PM \n📍 Polling Location:  Charlestown Senior Center, 223 Old Springfield Rd, Charlestown, NH 03603 \nAll registered voters in Charlestown are encouraged to participate. If you need to register to vote or request an absentee ballot, please visit or contact the Town Clerk’s Office prior to Election Day. Voters may also register at the polls on Election Day with proper identification and proof of residency. \nClick  HERE  for the Absentee Ballot Request Form \nClick  HERE  for Democratic Sample Ballot \nClick  HERE  for Republican Sample Ballot \nLatest News \n🗳️State GeneralElection🗳️ \nPlanning Board Meeting - 6:00pm Community Room  \nFinance Committee Meeting - 6:30pm Town Hall, 19 Summer Street  \nPUBLIC HEARING NOTICE for the Zoning Board of Adjustment \n\t\t\t View All \n RSS Feed \nTown of Charlestown, NH \n233 Main Street, PO Box 385 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Charlestown,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t NH \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t 03603 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t United States of America \nHours of Operation \nMonday: 7:00AM - 4:00PM \nTuesday: 8:00AM - 4:00PM \nWednesday: 8:00AM - 4:00PM \nThursday: 8:00AM - 4:00PM \nFriday: 7:00AM - 12:00PM \nSaturday: CLOSED - CLOSED \nSunday: CLOSED - CLOSED \nEmail  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t patricia@charlestown-nh.gov \nPhone \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t (603) 826-4400 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t (603) 826-3709 \nMade with \n\t\t by TownCloud \n\t © Copyright\n\t\t2026. All rights reserved.\n ",
